---
/**
 * Creed — homepage band stating the publication's worldview as a centered meditation.
 * The "deep meaning" surface: what the Lab believes, not what it published.
 */
---

<section class="creed" aria-label="The Creed">
  <div class="creed__orn" aria-hidden="true">❧ ❧ ❧</div>
  <blockquote class="creed__text">
    Most agents are workflows in costume. Reliability lives in the harness, the loop, and the gate, not the model. <b>Earn the complexity. Evidence over hype.</b>
  </blockquote>
</section>

<style>
  .creed { text-align: center; padding: var(--space-7) 0 var(--space-6); }
  .creed__orn { color: var(--brick); font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.6em; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .creed__text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 2.6vw, 25px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 34ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .creed__text b { color: var(--brick); font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
